1
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,127
这是一套面向中小企业的云协同办公系统。
This is a cloud collaboration platform built for small and mid-sized teams.

2
00:00:09,777 --> 00:00:14,630
组织、考勤、审批、文档、任务与会议全部打通。
Organization, attendance, approvals, docs, tasks and meetings connect here.

3
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:19,529
前后端完全分离，源码与部署流程全部开源。
Frontend and backend are decoupled, with full source and deploy flow public.

4
00:00:23,229 --> 00:00:26,470
前端是 Vue 3、路由 4 与 Element Plus 2。
The frontend uses Vue 3, Vue Router 4 and Element Plus 2.

5
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:31,183
状态用 Pinia，图表用 ECharts，请求走 Axios。
Pinia holds state, ECharts draws charts and Axios handles requests.

6
00:00:31,833 --> 00:00:35,609
后端是 SpringBoot 3 加 MyBatis，跑在 Java 17。
The backend is Spring Boot 3 with MyBatis on Java 17.

7
00:00:36,259 --> 00:00:40,382
开发用内嵌数据库，生产切换到 MySQL 8。
An embedded database serves development, MySQL 8 serves production.

8
00:00:44,082 --> 00:00:47,666
八个业务模块覆盖企业日常办公主线。
Eight modules cover the daily workflow of a real company.

9
00:00:48,316 --> 00:00:52,748
组织权限采用用户、角色、菜单三级模型。
Access control follows a three-tier user, role and menu model.

10
00:00:53,398 --> 00:00:56,996
审批中心支持串行节点、驳回与撤回。
The approval center supports serial nodes, rejection and withdrawal.

11
00:00:57,646 --> 00:01:00,192
会议室预约带时间段互斥检测。
Meeting room booking detects overlapping time slots.

12
00:01:03,892 --> 00:01:08,011
先看部署。后端用 Maven Wrapper 一条命令打包。
First, deployment: the backend builds with one Maven Wrapper command.

13
00:01:08,661 --> 00:01:12,434
六十六个源文件编译通过，产出可执行 Jar 包。
Sixty-six source files compile into one runnable jar.

14
00:01:13,084 --> 00:01:17,389
直接运行 Jar，四秒内服务在 8080 端口就绪。
Running the jar starts the service on port 8080 within four seconds.

15
00:01:18,039 --> 00:01:22,599
健康检查返回 UP，库表和演示数据已自动初始化。
Health check returns UP, with schema and demo data auto-initialized.

16
00:01:26,299 --> 00:01:31,016
前端装好依赖后构建，两千多个模块十五秒完成。
The frontend build transforms over two thousand modules in 15 seconds.

17
00:01:31,666 --> 00:01:34,742
开发时 Vite 把接口请求代理到后端服务。
In development, Vite proxies API calls to the backend.

18
00:01:35,392 --> 00:01:39,548
生产用 Nginx 托管静态资源并反向代理接口。
In production, Nginx serves static assets and reverse-proxies the API.

19
00:01:40,198 --> 00:01:43,890
Docker Compose 可一次拉起数据库、后端与前端。
Docker Compose brings up the database, backend and frontend at once.

20
00:01:47,590 --> 00:01:50,773
系统运行起来后，用管理员账号登录。
With the system running, sign in using the administrator account.

21
00:01:51,423 --> 00:01:55,799
登录成功后，服务端签发令牌并下发权限菜单。
On success, the server issues a token and returns authorized menus.

22
00:01:56,449 --> 00:02:00,901
左侧导航按角色动态生成，共十四个功能入口。
The sidebar is role-driven and contains fourteen feature entries.

23
00:02:04,601 --> 00:02:08,502
工作台聚合了实时业务数据，不是静态示例。
The dashboard aggregates live business data, not static samples.

24
00:02:09,152 --> 00:02:13,311
四张统计卡展示人数、审批、项目与打卡。
Four stat cards show headcount, approvals, projects and check-ins.

25
00:02:13,961 --> 00:02:17,730
图表由后端聚合查询直接供给前端渲染。
Charts are fed directly by backend aggregate queries.

26
00:02:18,380 --> 00:02:22,389
待办清单把审批任务和项目任务汇总在一处。
The to-do list merges approval tasks with project tasks.

27
00:02:26,089 --> 00:02:29,860
组织模块维护部门树、岗位与员工台账。
The org module maintains departments, positions and employees.

28
00:02:30,510 --> 00:02:35,044
员工表支持按部门、状态与关键字组合查询。
Employee queries combine department, status and keyword filters.

29
00:02:35,694 --> 00:02:39,308
角色授权页可勾选菜单与按钮权限码。
The role page assigns menu and button permission codes.

30
00:02:43,008 --> 00:02:46,737
登录口令用 PBKDF2 加盐散列后入库。
Passwords are stored as salted PBKDF2 hashes.

31
00:02:47,387 --> 00:02:51,806
令牌采用 HS256 签名，拦截器校验每个接口。
HS256 tokens are verified by an interceptor on every endpoint.

32
00:02:52,456 --> 00:02:55,726
写操作再由权限注解做二次校验。
Write operations get a second check through permission annotations.

33
00:02:56,376 --> 00:03:00,514
切面自动记录操作人、地址、耗时与结果。
An aspect logs operator, address, latency and result automatically.

34
00:03:04,214 --> 00:03:09,055
现在是真实操作录屏：在审批中心发起一张请假单。
Now a real screen capture: filing a leave request in the approval center.

35
00:03:09,705 --> 00:03:14,348
选择请假流程，填入标题、天数、日期与事由。
Choose the leave flow, then fill in title, days, dates and reason.

36
00:03:14,998 --> 00:03:19,729
提交后后端解析流程定义，创建首节点待办任务。
On submit, the backend parses the flow and creates the first task.

37
00:03:20,379 --> 00:03:23,320
列表立即出现一条审批中的新单据。
A new running request appears in the list immediately.

38
00:03:27,020 --> 00:03:31,247
切换到待我审批，能看到四条总经理终审任务。
Switching to my approvals shows four final-review tasks.

39
00:03:31,897 --> 00:03:34,548
点击通过并填写审批意见。
Click approve and enter a comment.

40
00:03:35,198 --> 00:03:38,936
确认后当前节点关闭，流程自动推进。
Confirming closes the node and advances the flow automatically.

41
00:03:39,586 --> 00:03:43,268
待办数量随之减少，全程都有审批留痕。
The pending count drops, and every step leaves an audit trail.

42
00:03:46,968 --> 00:03:50,626
工作流由定义、实例、任务三张表支撑。
The workflow rests on three tables: definition, instance and task.

43
00:03:51,276 --> 00:03:55,012
节点用 JSON 配置，按角色解析办理人。
Nodes are JSON-configured and assignees resolve by role.

44
00:03:55,662 --> 00:03:59,361
通过推进到下一节点，最后节点关闭单据。
Approval advances to the next node; the last one closes the request.

45
00:04:00,011 --> 00:04:03,408
驳回与撤回都会把剩余任务置为取消。
Rejection and withdrawal cancel all remaining tasks.

46
00:04:07,108 --> 00:04:11,303
任务协作是四列看板，卡片带负责人与进度。
Task collaboration uses a four-column board with owners and progress.

47
00:04:11,953 --> 00:04:15,216
点击卡片可切换状态、查看评论。
Clicking a card lets you move its status and read comments.

48
00:04:15,866 --> 00:04:19,171
状态流转会自动同步完成百分比。
Moving a card automatically updates its progress percentage.

49
00:04:22,871 --> 00:04:26,767
云文档支持真实上传、版本记录与下载计数。
Cloud docs support real uploads, versioning and download counts.

50
00:04:27,417 --> 00:04:31,283
考勤页按九点与十八点判定迟到和早退。
Attendance flags late arrivals and early departures against the schedule.

51
00:04:31,933 --> 00:04:35,230
公告带置顶、分类与已读回执。
Notices support pinning, categories and read receipts.

52
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:39,430
日程模块对同一会议室做互斥校验。
The calendar rejects overlapping room bookings.

53
00:04:43,130 --> 00:04:48,508
从建库、鉴权到审批流，这是一套可运行的完整系统。
From schema and auth to workflows, this is a complete runnable system.

54
00:04:49,158 --> 00:04:54,045
仓库地址在画面底部，包含源码、文档与部署脚本。
The repository link sits at the bottom, with source, docs and deploy scripts.

55
00:04:54,695 --> 00:04:58,145
克隆之后两条命令即可在本地复现。
Clone it and two commands reproduce the whole demo locally.
